title: "TPx: A Pipeline-Centric Taxonomy and Corpus for Cross-Lingual RAG"
abstract: "TPx provides a three-axis taxonomy (Transfer Point, Translation Strategy, Resource Level), a coded evidence base of 116 papers, and reporting infrastructure for cross-lingual retrieval-augmented generation research."
